---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT x.a FROM t x JOIN t y ON x.a = y.c WHERE y.b = 'q'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (CAST(a#0 AS BIGINT) == c#5)
   :- Project [a#0]
   :  +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1, c#2] (shared #1)
   +- Project [c#5]
      +- Shift +3
         +- Filter (b#1 == 'q')
            +- Shared #1, printed above
